    "t": "What are you drinking?"
  },
  {
    "s": 4026.5,
    "e": 4029.3,
    "t": "A beer, with all due respect."
  },
  {
    "s": 4041.9,
    "e": 4045.6,
    "t": "When you see a place like this,"
  },
  {
