    "t": "Is that my fault?"
  },
  {
    "s": 4817.4,
    "e": 4818.2,
    "t": "No."
  },
  {
    "s": 4820.5,
    "e": 4822.2,
    "t": "I don't even know how to say"
  },
  {
    "s": 4822.4,
